            <ArticleTitle>Spontaneous resolution of neoaneurysm following implantation of a paclitaxel-eluting coronary stent.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>e12-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report a case of spontaneous resolution of neoaneurysm of the coronary artery complicating paclitaxel-eluting TAXUS stent implantation in the proximal left anterior descending artery in a 56-year-old female.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
